# Code owners
#
# Request reviews for release files, repository automation, licence and security
# texts. Ownership of scenario/ as a whole would request owners on every change.
# Both owners must be on the same line; paths are root-anchored, last match wins.
#
# This file defines requested reviewers, not permissions or required approvals.
# The main - review ruleset currently does not require code-owner approval.
# Changing that policy or team access is a separate repository-admin decision.
# Requests use the CODEOWNERS file on the PR base branch; drafts request owners
# when marked ready for review.

